Package: friendlyspots
Title: Spatial Similarity of Spatial Transcriptomics Samples
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("George", "Hall", email = "george.hall@ucl.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(affiliation = "University College London")),
    person("University College London", role = "cph"))
Description: Computes the similarity between spatial transcriptomics
    samples from counts of label-to-label connections between neighboring
    spots.
